An attacker could possibly use these to compromise the system.
This update corrects flaws in the following subsystems:
  - x86 architecture;
  - InfiniBand drivers;
  - Network drivers;
  - NVME drivers;
  - Ext4 file system;
  - SMB network file system;
  - IPv4 networking;
  - Network traffic control;
  - TCP network protocol;
  - Locking primitives;
  - IPv6 networking;
  - Multipath TCP;
  - Netfilter;
  - Open vSwitch;
  - SCTP protocol;
  - SMC sockets;
